#: includes/class-aipk-admin.php:615
msgid ""
"Scanning reads each original and carries the marking into sizes that lack "
"it. It runs in small batches and can be repeated safely. The shortcode "
"[ai_act_disclosure] and the \"AI disclosure notice\" block print a "
"transparency notice with the count."
msgstr ""

